    "wink_right/wink_left and phoneme_A/U/E/I/O are provisional reference targets set to 100 for the named morph only; verify whether right/left labels match the avatar's visual sides.",
    "This file stores target examples, not calibration measurements. A calibration system can compare live measurements to these targets or interpolate between states."
